```
Its handler, **`.../rest/escalation/MissingOwnerFieldsExceptionHandler.java`** (`@Parameter` receives the thrown exception; `ObjectResponse` sends the HTTP response):
```java
public class MissingOwnerFieldsExceptionHandler {
